  "description": "A quiet rural village. Alec, a handsome transfer student from the city, spots So-Ho, shunned by everyone for \"shooing away even forest monsters.\" Alec, who was trying to unravel his own hidden, twisted complexes toward So-Ho, is overcome by an inexplicable emotion the moment he meets So-Ho's eyes behind his glasses. The forest he and So-Ho went to escape his father becomes their private nest.\n\n *\"You will become my monster.\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
